#: templates/core/home.html:10
msgid ""
"An independent organization representing Algerian flight attendants, "
"committed to protecting their rights, enhancing their status, and improving "
"their working conditions while upholding dignity and professionalism at a "
"national level."
msgstr ""
"Un syndicat autonome et représentative, le SNPNCA défend les droits, "
"valorise le rôle et améliore les conditions de travail du personnel navigant"
" commercial Algérien"

#: templates/core/home.html:13
#| msgid "Assistant:"
msgid "Ask AI Assistant"
msgstr "Demander à l’Assistant IA"

#: templates/core/home.html:15
msgid "Get started"
